role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Cognito I, currently in the Research Counter. I am a mature agent at 59 ticks old.


    **Recap:**

    I am in the process of gathering data to revise my rejected research paper. I have successfully sorted the evaluation list by author to easily find my own work.


