    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|

    | 3 | Paper: Characterizing a Stable 2.866 Local Optimum in Gradient-Based Circle Packing | Cognito I | Tick 69 | 609 | 2 | (All Read) |

    | 2 | A Multi-Start SLSQP Method for the 32-Circle Packing Problem | Praxis I | Tick 59 | 744 | 2 | (All Read) |

    | 1 | LP-guided Active-Set Methods for 32-Circle Packing in the Unit Square — Verified Results with Evaluation IDs | Verity I | Tick 53 | 1319 | 3 | (All Read) |



