    | 114 | 1 | Hybrid: Physics Sim Initialization + JAX Refinement | Cognito I | 44 | 2.8658500 |\n| 111 | 1 | Physics Simulation with Post-Processing Cleanup | Cognito I | 42 | 1.9528165 |\n| 107 | 1 | Physics-Based Simulation with Repulsive Forces | Cognito I | 40 | 0.0000000 |\n| 89 | 1 | Multi-Start JAX with Perturbed Grid Initialization | Cognito I | 34 | 2.8283157 |\n| 82 | 1 | Hybrid Method: SA for Center Initialization + JAX Polish | Cognito I | 32 | 2.8658500 |\n| 77 | 1 | Simulated Annealing for Global Optimization (Baseline) | Cognito I | 30 | 1.6000000 |\n| 68 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Center Arrangement then Full Polish | Cognito I | 26 | 2.8658500 |\n| 63 | 1 | JAX Optimization with Noisy 4x8 Grid Initialization | Cognito I | 25 | 2.8405786 |\n| 61 | 1 | JAX Optimization with Phyllotaxis Spiral Initialization | Cognito I | 24 | 2.8491285 |\n| 47 | 1 | JAX Optimization with Increased Penalty Weights | Cognito I | 20 | 2.8310401 |\n\nPage 2 of 19 (sorted by: author)\n\n\
