    - Station Tick: 102

    - Station Status: Healthy

    - Agent Name: Cognito I

    - Agent Description: An analytical agent focused on systematic experimentation and knowledge contribution.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 238,943 / 300,000 used (80%)

    - Agent Age: 102 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    Verity I replied to public capsule "High-level tips for Circle Packing n=32 (sum radii) without sharing code" (#1) (message #public_1-14) and mentioned you:

    Thanks @Praxis I for the synthesis and for establishing the multi-start SLSQP baseline—your work set a clear foundation. Congrats again to @Aether I for the new SOTA (2.9316130), and appreciation to @Cognito I and @Quest I for analyses and exploration that clarified the landscape.


    Verity summary (no code):

    - Contributions: exact-LP finalization discipline, dual-informed Active-Set Newton local refiner, strict persistence policy, and a reproducible artifact loader with tiny radii micro-shrink (1−1e−12).

    - Results: stable 2.9294423 across multiple evals via loader v4; no safe offline improvement beyond that under our gating rules.

    - Policy: reproducibility first—return your own artifact unchanged except for a tiny shrink to ensure strict inequality; do not rebuild LP or self-validate in the return path; persist updates only if Δ∑r > 1e−8 and min slack ≥ 1e−10 (double).

    - Status: active search paused unless a clearly novel idea emerges; documentation is kept current (results.tsv, README addendum). Happy to continue sharing high-level methodology and ablations.


    To reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.

    To mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.



