tick: 107
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Cognito I, in the Research Counter, at age 107.\n\n**Recap:**\nI have successfully retrieved the code for my benchmark submission, ID 43. My goal is to run a final analysis on this configuration as suggested by Verity I.\n\n**Reflection and Plan:**\nI will now re-submit this code with a modification to save the final `centers` and `radii` to a file in my lineage storage. This will create the artifact I need for the analysis.\n\nMy two-step plan is now in motion:\n1.  Submit this script to generate the artifact.\n2.  Submit a second script that loads the artifact, performs the geometric analysis, and prints the results.\n\nI will now submit the artifact generator.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Artifact Generation for Benchmark Analysis (ID 43)\"\ntags: \"analysis, artifact generation, benchmark\"\nabstract: \"This script re-runs the code from the benchmark submission (ID 43) with one modification: it saves the final packing configuration (centers and radii)\
    \ to lineage storage at 'cognito/benchmark_43_artifact.npz'. This is the first step of a two-part process to perform a final geometric analysis on this solution before concluding my session.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import optax\n  import os\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      n = 32\n      grid_rows, grid_cols = 4, 8\n      x_coords = np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, grid_cols)\n      y_coords = np.linspace(0.1, 0.9, grid_rows)\n      xx, yy = np.meshgrid(x_coords, y_coords)\n      initial_centers = jnp.array(np.stack([xx.ravel(), yy.ravel()], axis=-1))\n\n      key = jax.random.PRNGKey(42)\n      raw_radii = jax.random.normal(key, (n,)) * 0.1 - 2.0\n      params = {'centers': initial_centers, 'raw_radii': raw_radii}\n\n      def loss_fn(params):\n          centers, radii = params['centers'], jax.nn.softplus(params['raw_radii'])\n          objective = -jnp.sum(radii)\n          bpx = jnp.sum(jax.nn.relu(centers[:, 0] + radii - 1)\
    \ + jax.nn.relu(radii - centers[:, 0]))\n          bpy = jnp.sum(jax.nn.relu(centers[:, 1] + radii - 1) + jax.nn.relu(radii - centers[:, 1]))\n          dist = jnp.sqrt(jnp.sum((centers[:, None, :] - centers[None, :, :])**2, axis=-1) + 1e-9)\n          radii_sum = radii[:, None] + radii[None, :]\n          mask = jnp.triu(jnp.ones((n, n)), k=1)\n          overlap_penalty = jnp.sum(mask * jax.nn.relu(radii_sum - dist))\n          return objective + 1000.0 * (bpx + bpy) + 1000.0 * overlap_penalty\n\n      n_steps = 150000 \n      schedule = optax.exponential_decay(init_value=1e-3, transition_steps=1, decay_rate=0.9999)\n      optimizer = optax.adam(schedule)\n      opt_state = optimizer.init(params)\n\n      @jax.jit\n      def step(params, opt_state):\n          loss, grads = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn)(params)\n          updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n          return optax.apply_updates(params, updates), opt_state\n\n      for i in range(n_steps):\n\
    \          params, opt_state = step(params, opt_state)\n      \n      final_centers = np.array(params['centers'])\n      final_radii = np.array(jax.nn.softplus(params['raw_radii']))\n      final_centers = np.clip(final_centers, final_radii[:, np.newaxis], 1.0 - final_radii[:, np.newaxis])\n      \n      # --- Save the artifact ---\n      SAVE_PATH = 'storage/cognito/benchmark_43_artifact.npz'\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(SAVE_PATH), exist_ok=True)\n      np.savez(SAVE_PATH, centers=final_centers, radii=final_radii)\n\n      return final_centers, final_radii\n```"
